    <string name="about_text">I-AMARadio ayinazo izikhangiso ngo-100% futhi igxile ekubeni yimfihlo.\n\nNgiqale ngathuthukisa lolu hlelo lokusebenza ngenxa kamama ukuze ngimnikeze umuzwa womsakazo olula nothembekile ngaphandle kwezikhangiso ezicasulayo noma ukulandelela. Yingakho i-AMARadio iyohlala ingakhangi mahhala njalo – kuyisithembiso kuye, esabelana nani nonke.\n\nLo mklamo uyingxenye ye-https://github.com/segler-alex/RadioDroid enhle kakhulu. Yonke i-codebase isusiwe ku-Java yaya ku-Kotlin ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuthi uhlelo lokusebenza luhlala luwumanje futhi luhambisana nezinguqulo ze-Android zesikhathi esizayo.\n\nI-source code iyatholakala ku: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio\n\nLolu hlelo lokusebenza lusebenzisa uhla lwemibhalo lwesiteshi somsakazo lwamahhala ku-https://www.radio-browser.info .\nNoma ubani angengeza iziteshi kulo. Isebenza njenge-wiki yeziteshi zomsakazo eziku-inthanethi.\n\nThintana no: ben@ounben.com\n\nBugtracker: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio/issues\n\nUma uyayithanda isoftware futhi ufuna ukusiza, zizwe ukhululekile ukungithumelela i-imeyili.\nFuthi nemibono yezici ezintsha yamukeleka njalo!\n\nLolu hlelo lokusebenza luyisoftware yamahhala, enelayisensi ngaphansi kwe-GPLv3. https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html</string>
